# sshd of the controller (owner: 10-clixon-controller): lab-api's way into the controller CLI, as one of the three
# NOC roles or as itself. Keys only (lab-api's public key, from the shared volume controller-keys), from lab-api's
# address only (contract section 4), and every session is the controller CLI (ForceCommand; the users' login shell is
# the CLI too): no shell, no forwarding, no files. Not published on the host: labnet only.
Port 22
AddressFamily inet
ListenAddress 0.0.0.0
HostKey /var/lib/controller/sshd/ssh_host_ed25519_key
PidFile /run/sshd.pid

AllowUsers noc-engineer@172.30.10.50 network-engineer@172.30.10.50 noc-manager@172.30.10.50 lab-api@172.30.10.50
AuthorizedKeysFile /etc/netsim/keys/lab-api.pub
AuthenticationMethods publickey
PubkeyAuthentication yes
PasswordAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
PermitEmptyPasswords no
PermitRootLogin no
UsePAM no
StrictModes yes

ForceCommand /usr/local/bin/controller-cli
DisableForwarding yes
PermitTTY no
PermitTunnel no
PermitUserRC no
PermitUserEnvironment no

LoginGraceTime 10
MaxStartups 30:50:60
ClientAliveInterval 30
ClientAliveCountMax 2
LogLevel INFO
